{"v":4,"catch":"在京都市的中心和200隻可愛小貓玩捉迷藏！","desc":"《Cats and Seek: Kyoto》是這個備受喜愛的系列中第三部溫馨冒險作品。\n\n探索京都市中心的迷人景點，和可愛的貓咪們玩捉迷藏！\n\n無論你是獨自一人還是和好友同玩，遊戲中舒緩的音效、可愛的畫面和休閒的玩法都能讓你放鬆心情。\n\n遊戲特色：\n- 200多隻隱藏的貓咪等你來發現\n- 新增功能！你可以在拍照和塗色模式中將場景定格並上色。\n- 免費提示助你順利過關\n- 透過存檔系統追蹤你的進度\n- 可調整遊戲色彩、亮度和對比度！","publisher":"Silesia Games","release":"2025-10-09","genres":["益智","冒險","桌上遊戲","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/538e29b357651a30243bed148a8d4aa25cb5b19dd83904bf3017caa4cf0e6f5c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2e6c6951b7d8239cdee4f6179cecff67460462bf789d34ba4a97c2431a2eb391.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/32522109758380586cb348ff1e01ec147460b2eb95c3ab3e3068eacc22ebd3e0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/30772fafee73a28e6fe1062ea5cf6fa624273c22cd40daa1a5d065b7bdd5582d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/37386e8108fd8f384825fa85d83502ccbde4e46a2eef724fbe35d932c5539e4e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a2e4f062fa385e1405efc64350fc3be759df4e0c00a99d75af80d0a30d870011.jpg"],"titleId":"01006fe02465a000","dlc":[]}